TRIGGERS

The project uses 3 triggers.

1. trg_auto_grade

This trigger computes Grade and PASS/FAIL automatically whenever a result is inserted.

```sql
DELIMITER $$
CREATE TRIGGER trg_auto_grade
BEFORE INSERT ON RESULT
FOR EACH ROW
BEGIN
    IF NEW.Percentage >= 80 THEN
        SET NEW.Grade = 'A';
    ELSEIF NEW.Percentage >= 70 THEN
        SET NEW.Grade = 'B';
    ELSEIF NEW.Percentage >= 60 THEN
        SET NEW.Grade = 'C';
    ELSEIF NEW.Percentage >= 50 THEN
        SET NEW.Grade = 'D';
    ELSE
        SET NEW.Grade = 'F';
    END IF;

    IF NEW.Percentage >= 50 THEN
        SET NEW.Status = 'PASS';
    ELSE
        SET NEW.Status = 'FAIL';
    END IF;
END$$
DELIMITER ;
```

2. trg_add_answer_marks

This trigger updates the total marks of an exam attempt whenever an answer record is inserted.

```sql
DELIMITER $$
CREATE TRIGGER trg_add_answer_marks
AFTER INSERT ON ANSWER
FOR EACH ROW
BEGIN
    UPDATE EXAM_ATTEMPT
       SET Marks_Obtained = Marks_Obtained + NEW.Marks_Scored
     WHERE Attempt_ID = NEW.Attempt_ID;
END$$
DELIMITER ;
```

3. trg_check_attempt_marks

This trigger prevents invalid marks from being entered or updated.

```sql
DELIMITER $$
CREATE TRIGGER trg_check_attempt_marks
BEFORE UPDATE ON EXAM_ATTEMPT
FOR EACH ROW
BEGIN
    DECLARE exam_total INT;

    SELECT Total_Marks INTO exam_total
    FROM EXAM
    WHERE Exam_ID = NEW.Exam_ID;

    IF NEW.Marks_Obtained < 0 OR NEW.Marks_Obtained > exam_total THEN
        SIGNAL SQLSTATE '45000'
        SET MESSAGE_TEXT = 'INVALID MARKS: value must be between 0 and the exam Total_Marks';
    END IF;
END$$
DELIMITER ;
```

